    "title": "What channel is Wisconsin vs High Point on today? NCAA time, TV",
    "text": "March 19, 2026, 7:01 a.m. CTDefense usually travels in the NCAA Tournament, but when Wisconsin plays High Point in a first-round game Thursday March 19, it's the offense of both teams that'll be on full display far away from home in the West Region.Most fans are familiar with the fifth-seeded Badgers' three-point-friendly offense that averages 83 points a game. But they might not have a clue that the 12th-seeded Panthers are averaging 90, second in Division I. The Badgers have set a Big Ten record with 400 three-pointers this season, averaging more than 11.7 per game. High Point also lets it fly, averaging 9.2 triples per game. The Panthers have scored 90 or more 13 times and Badgers have hit the same number 12 times.Guards Nick Boyd and John Blackwell have combined to average 39.6 points per game for the Badgers (24-10). They'll likely need to continue to carry the majority of the offensive load, like they did in the Big Ten Tournament when together they averaged 51 points.Watch Wisconsin vs High Point on SlingThe likely return of Nolan Winter from injury will give the Badgers frontcourt a boost and possibly help them make another deep run in the West Region. The 2001, 2015 and 2016 Wisconsin teams that made the Final Four all came out of the West.High Point (30-4) is one of six Division I teams to win 30 games. The Panthers feature a balanced roster, with three players averaging double figures in scoring and six averaging at least 8.7 points per game.The winner plays fourth-seeded Arkansas or 13th-seeded Hawaii on Saturday, March 21. Here's how to watch and listen to game:What channel is Wisconsin vs High Point on today in March Madness?TV: TBSStream: You can stream the game on the NCAA March Madness app through your TV provider or on Sling, which has an NCAA Tournament special offer.Wisconsin will tip off vs. High Point on TBS. Streaming options include the NCAA March Madness Live app and Sling, which has an NCAA Tournament special offer. Announcers for the game are Brad Nessler (play-by-play), Wally Szczerbiak (analyst), and Jared Greenberg (sideline reporter).Wisconsin vs High Point start time in NCAA bracketDate: Thursday, March 19Time: 12:50 p.m. CTWisconsin and High Point will play at 12:50 p.m. CT at the Moda Center in Portland, Oregon.How can I listen to Wisconsin vs High Point on the radio?Radio: WOKY (920 AM), plus a statewide network of stations.Announcers: Matt Lepay (play-by-play) and Brian Butch (analyst) will call the game.Is the Wisconsin vs High Point game on SiriusXM Radio?Yes, the broadcast is on Channel 204.Wisconsin vs High Point odds in March MadnessOdds courtesy of MGM as of March 19Spread: Wisconsin by 10.5Over/under: 162.5Moneyline: Wisconsin -475, High Point +360Wisconsin basketball schedule 2025-26Below are the past five games of Wisconsin's 2025-26 basketball season. For the full schedule, click hereMarch 14: Michigan 68, Wisconsin 65 in Big Ten Tournament semifinals in ChicagoMarch 13: Wisconsin 91, Illinois 88 (OT) in Big Ten Tournament quarterfinals in ChicagoMarch 12: Wisconsin 85, Washington 82 in Big Ten tournament third round in ChicagoMarch 7: Wisconsin 97, Purdue 93March 4: Wisconsin 78, Maryland 45High Point basketball schedule 2025-26Below are the past five games of High Point's 2025-26 basketball season. For the full schedule, click hereMarch 8: High Point 91, Winthrop 76 in Big South Tournament championship in Johnson City, TennesseeMarch 7: High Point 75, UNC-Asheville 71 in Big South Tournament semifinals in Johnson City, TennesseeMarch 6: High Point 81, Gardner-Webb 59 in Big South Tournament quarterfinals in Johnson City, TennesseeFeb. 26: High Point 79, Presbyterian 73Feb. 21: High Point 89, Winthrop 87Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.Gambling involves risk. Please only gamble with funds t